<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Proposta Comercial - <%= proposal.title %></title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #071A2B;
      color: #F3F7F8;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #071A2B;
      padding: 40px 10px;
    }
    .main-card {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #0A2136;
      border: 1px solid #1A3D5D;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0D2A44;
      padding: 28px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1A3D5D;
    }
    .company-name {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: <%= company && company.primaryColor ? company.primaryColor : '#066B63' %>;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px 28px;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #8AA4B7;
      margin: 0 0 24px 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .details-box {
      background: rgba(6, 107, 99, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid <%= company && company.primaryColor ? company.primaryColor : '#066B63' %>;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .detail-label {
      color: #8AA4B7;
    }
    .detail-val {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #F3F7F8;
    }
    .total-val {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: <%= company && company.primaryColor ? company.primaryColor : '#066B63' %>;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .btn-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0 20px 0;
    }
    .cta-btn {
      background-color: <%= company && company.primaryColor ? company.primaryColor : '#066B63' %>;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 16px 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(6, 107, 99, 0.4);
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #071A2B;
      padding: 20px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #8AA4B7;
      border-top: 1px solid #1A3D5D;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="main-card">
      <div class="header">
        <% if (company && company.logoUrl) { %>
          <img src="<%= company.logoUrl %>" alt="<%= company.name %>" style="max-height: 48px;">
        <% } else { %>
          <h2 class="company-name"><%= company ? company.name : 'SimAprova' %></h2>
        <% } %>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h1 class="title"><%= proposal.title %></h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          Olá, <strong><%= proposal.clientName %></strong>!<br>
          Sua proposta comercial oficial já está pronta para análise e assinatura digital.
        </p>

        <div class="details-box">
          <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label" style="padding-bottom: 8px;">Cliente:</td>
              <td class="detail-val" align="right" style="padding-bottom: 8px;"><%= proposal.clientName %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label" style="padding-bottom: 8px;">Vendedor Responsável:</td>
              <td class="detail-val" align="right" style="padding-bottom: 8px;"><%= (proposal.user && proposal.user.name) ? proposal.user.name : (company ? company.name : 'Equipe Comercial') %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label" style="padding-bottom: 8px;">Validade:</td>
              <td class="detail-val" align="right" style="padding-bottom: 8px;">15 Dias</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="detail-label" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF;">Investimento Total:</td>
              <td class="detail-val total-val" align="right">R$ <%= parseFloat(proposal.totalValue || 0).toFixed(2) %></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="btn-container">
          <a href="<%= publicUrl %>" target="_blank" class="cta-btn">Visualizar Proposta Comercial</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        Este e-mail foi gerado automaticamente por <strong><%= company ? company.name : 'SimAprova' %></strong>.<br>
        Acordo Sólido — Confiança Imediatamente Visível.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
